  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n((25)⁴+1250+1-(25)²)/((25)²+26)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a+b)/(c)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (25)⁴ = 390625\n\n⇒ (25)² = 625\n\n⇒ Numerator: 390625 + 1250 + 1 - 625 = 391251\n\n⇒ Denominator: 625 + 26 = 651\n\n⇒ (391251)/(651) = 601\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 601.**",
